      ],
      "structure_description": "A central Yb atom is coordinated exclusively by chloride anions. Four peripheral Yb atoms each bind a κ3-Tp^tBu,Me ligand and two bridging chlorides, giving the reported {Yb5} connectivity; the authors obtained only a poor-quality connectivity structure.",
      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "ph": null,
        "procedure": "In a small-scale reaction, slowly add a toluene solution of AlMe3 to compound 9a dissolved in toluene; stir at ambient temperature. The paper describes formation of cluster 13 as reduction of the Yb(III) precursor.",
